# TEMPORARY WORKAROUND: data.gouv resources replaced by INSEE's own release.
#
# Used when a data.gouv resource of fichier-des-personnes-decedees is broken
# while INSEE serves the right month on https://www.insee.fr/fr/information/4190491
# (CSV, converted by insee-csv-to-txt.awk). See `datagouv-insee-overrides` in the
# Makefile. This file is deliberately outside tagfiles.version: adding or
# removing an entry must not change DATAPREP_VERSION.
#
# Remove an entry once data.gouv serves the right file; the converted file
# already in storage is then kept as is (same name, same records).
#
# <file in storage, without .gz> <INSEE archive>
